  67: def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
  68:     """
  69:     Propagate seed colors through a gray pipe network and resolve crossings by local neighbor majority.
  70: 
  71:     Input structure:
  72:     - The background is black.
  73:     - Gray pixels form a one-cell-wide orthogonal pipe network with straight runs, bends,
  74:       and some four-way crossings.
  75:     - Non-gray seed pixels sit at pipe endpoints; each ordinary pipe segment is associated
  76:       with exactly one seed when crossings are removed.
  77: 
  78:     Rule:
  79:     - Infer the gray pipe color and treat four-way junction cells as unresolved crossings.
  80:     - First recolor every non-crossing gray pipe segment with the unique seed color adjacent
  81:       to that segment, while seed pixels themselves stay unchanged.
